# What `helm package` leaves out of the published chart.
#
# Without this file every path under the chart directory ships, which meant the
# thirty-six helm-unittest suites travelled inside every install - roughly half
# the chart directory by size, to a machine that cannot run them and has no
# helm-unittest to run them with.
#
# What is NOT excluded is deliberate. `examples/` is referenced throughout the
# README and is what `helm lint` and `make conform` render against; `presets.yaml`
# is read at render time by the template that resolves a preset name; and
# `profiles/` carries the seccomp profile an operator has to place on a node, so
# it is needed precisely by the person who received the package.
tests/

# The suites are run against the chart directory, never against the package, so
# excluding them here costs `make test` nothing.

# Editor and platform noise, none of which is part of a chart.
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
*.orig
*.bak

# Version control.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
